  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The One Who Sins Will Die",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.18.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.18.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"What do you people mean by quoting this proverb about the land of Israel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'The parents eat sour grapes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the children's teeth are set on edge'?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"As surely as I live, declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.18.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.18.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", you will no longer quote this proverb in Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For everyone belongs to me, the parent as well as the child—both alike belong to me. The one who sins is the one who will die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Suppose there is a righteous man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who does what is just and right.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He does not eat at the mountain shrines",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or look to the idols of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He does not defile his neighbor's wife",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or have sexual relations with a woman during her period.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He does not oppress anyone,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but returns what he took in pledge for a loan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He does not commit robbery",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but gives his food to the hungry",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and provides clothing for the naked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He does not lend to them at interest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or take a profit from them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He withholds his hand from doing wrong",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and judges fairly between two parties.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He follows my decrees",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and faithfully keeps my laws.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "That man is righteous;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he will surely live,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.18.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Suppose he has a violent son, who sheds blood or does any of these other things",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(though the father has done none of them):",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"He eats at the mountain shrines.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He defiles his neighbor's wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He oppresses the poor and needy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He commits robbery.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He does not return what he took in pledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He looks to the idols.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He does detestable things.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He lends at interest and takes a profit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "EZK 18:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Will such a man live? He will not! Because he has done all these detestable things, he is to be put to death; his blood will be on his own head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But suppose this son has a son who sees all the sins his father commits, and though he sees them, he does not do such things:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"He does not eat at the mountain shrines",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or look to the idols of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He does not defile his neighbor's wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He does not oppress anyone",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or require a pledge for a loan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He does not commit robbery",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but gives his food to the hungry",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and provides clothing for the naked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He withholds his hand from mistreating the poor",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 18:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and takes no interest or profit from them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 18:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He keeps my laws and follows my decrees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "EZK 18:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He will not die for his father's sin; he will surely live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But his father will die for his own sin, because he practiced extortion, robbed his brother and did what was wrong among his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Yet you ask, 'Why does the son not share the guilt of his father?' Since the son has done what is just and right and has been careful to keep all my decrees, he will surely live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The one who sins is the one who will die. The child will not share the guilt of the parent, nor will the parent share the guilt of the child. The righteousness of the righteous will be credited to them, and the wickedness of the wicked will be charged against them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But if a wicked person turns away from all the sins they have committed and keeps all my decrees and does what is just and right, that person will surely live; they will not die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None of the offenses they have committed will be remembered against them. Because of the righteous things they have done, they will live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do I take any pleasure in the death of the wicked? declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.18.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.18.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Rather, am I not pleased when they turn from their ways and live?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But if a righteous person turns from their righteousness and commits sin and does the same detestable things the wicked person does, will they live? None of the righteous things that person has done will be remembered. Because of the unfaithfulness they are guilty of and because of the sins they have committed, they will die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Yet you say, 'The way of the Lord is not just.' Hear, you Israelites: Is my way unjust? Is it not your ways that are unjust?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a righteous person turns from their righteousness and commits sin, they will die for it; because of the sin they have committed they will die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if a wicked person turns away from the wickedness they have committed and does what is just and right, they will save their life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because they consider all the offenses they have committed and turn away from them, that person will surely live; they will not die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet the Israelites say, 'The way of the Lord is not just.' Are my ways unjust, people of Israel? Is it not your ways that are unjust?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Therefore, you Israelites, I will judge each of you according to your own ways, declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.18.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Repent! Turn away from all your offenses; then sin will not be your downfall.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rid yourselves of all the offenses you have committed, and get a new heart and a new spirit. Why will you die, people of Israel?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I take no pleasure in the death of anyone, declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.18.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Repent and live!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
